at|^j TABLE OF CONTENTS|fp||

ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Lebensohl^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  If you only learn one thing about bidding, you should learn Bergen evaluation^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  You should rely on the Law of Total Tricks once partner preempts^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  A jump raise in competition is weak^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Bergen Hand Evaluation is crucial in proper bidding^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  Law of Total Tricks does not apply when you have game forcing or game invitational value^*N|


