UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This is a very good slam because of the @DJ and depends on diamonds being no worse than 4-2. Failing that, the spade finesse. This hand demonstrates why holding a ten in a long suit is often crucial and also once again why |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenhandevaluation,Bergen Hand Evaluation^*N|CP||FP||at| is so useful. Very few pairs would get to slam with only 27 HCP between them.|
