mb|1D|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|1N|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In this situation most people play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,New Minor Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at| to allow responder to find out if East has 3 spades. But I prefer |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,Checkback Stayman^*N|CP||FP||at|. On this hand, whether playing either West bids 2@C to find out if East has 3 spades.|
