nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On the other hand, if East had opened 1@C, then |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=nmf,(New Minor Forcing)^*N|CP||FP||at| bid would be 2@D and 2@C if playing |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=checkback,(Checkback Stayman)^*N|CP||FP||at|. To learn more about both please click the blue links in the parenthesis and view the related tutoral at my website.|
