UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As it turns out 4@S is not a good contract especially on that lead. It is often not a good idea to ruff with a natural trump trick. You should use your high trump to draw declarer's trump. So West made the right decision to only bid 3@S as I would have bid 4@S and been down.|
